    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="10">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 10</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XI} Gif mon hæme mid twelfhyndes monnes wife, hundtwelftig scill gebete ðam were; syxhundum men hundteontig scill gebete; cierliscum men feowertig scill gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person has intercourse with the wife of a 1,200-man, let him pay 120 shillings to the husband; for a 600-man let him pay 100 shillings; for a man of ceorl rank let him pay 40 shillings</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone lies with the wife of a man whose wergeld is 1200 shillings, he shall pay 120 shillings compensation to the husband; to a husband whose wergeld is 600 shillings, he shall pay 100 shillings; to a commoner he shall pay 40 shillings compensation [for a similar offence].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XI. Gif mon hæme mid XIIhyndes monnes wife, CXX scll' gebete (man)þam were; syxhyndum men C scill' gebete; cyrliscum men XL scll' gebete.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
